{
  "about": "An agent's outbound call that goes as planned: the bridge dials, the person answers and hears the opening, the agent listens and answers twice, then records the outcome; the closing plays and the bridge hangs up. Times are seconds after the call was placed; the bridge acknowledges every command it takes.",
